---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import ConfirmOfficial from "../components/ConfirmOfficial.astro";
import InterestForm from "../components/InterestForm.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Andorra permit letters | A.1, J.1, D.1, B.1"
  description="Official Andorran permit letters, then the 2026 pages: passive residency, company and active residency, and the three things people confuse."
  path="/become-a-resident"
>
  <section class="page-header">
    <h1>Permit letters</h1>
    <p>
      The Government’s codes. The pages that cost money in 2026 are
      next to them.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="prose">
    <ConfirmOfficial />

    <p>
      People searching “passive residency” or “residencia pasiva”
      usually mean D.1, residència sense activitat lucrativa. Some
      sites call the investment route a golden visa; that is not an
      official Andorran name. Read
      <a href="/residency-vs-tax">Three things people confuse</a>
      before you mix the card with tax or a house.
    </p>

    <h2>The official letters</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>A.1</strong> is residence and work for an Andorran
      employer.
      <strong>J.1</strong> is residence and work on your own account —
      <a href="/company-active-residency">Company and active residency</a>.
      <strong>D.1</strong> is residence without taking local employment —
      <a href="/passive-residency">Passive residency in 2026</a>.
      <strong>B.1</strong> is family reunification.
      <strong>C.1</strong> is frontier work.
      <strong>D.3</strong> (digital nomad) and
      <strong>D.4</strong> (entrepreneur programmes) are still on
      Govern.ad.
    </p>
    <p>
      Immigration index:
      <a
        href="https://www.govern.ad/ca/tematiques/immigracio/residencia-i-treball"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener">residència i treball</a
      >
      and
      <a
        href="https://www.govern.ad/ca/tematiques/immigracio/residencia"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener">residència</a
      >.
      Llei 2/2026 is in the
      <a
        href="https://bopadocuments.blob.core.windows.net/bopa-documents/038015/pdf/CGL_2026_02_12_10_11_12.pdf"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener">BOPA</a
      >.
    </p>

    <h2>The 2026 pages</h2>
    <div class="official-links">
      <a href="/residency-vs-tax">Three things people confuse</a>
      <a href="/passive-residency">Passive residency in 2026</a>
      <a href="/company-active-residency">Company and active residency</a>
      <a href="/the-file">The file and the bank</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <InterestForm
    intro="Leave an email if you want an introduction to residency counsel. We’ll write back."
    source="become-a-resident"
  />
</Base>
